      {w:"sarcasm",p:"noun",ipa:"/ˈsɑːkæzəm/",def:"a way of using words that are the opposite of what you mean in order to be unpleasant to somebody or to make fun of them",tr:"kinoya / sarkazm",ex:"'I can't wait to get in that freezing water,' she said with sarcasm."}
