      {w:"shopping list",p:"noun",ipa:"/ˈʃɒpɪŋ lɪst/",def:"a list of things that you need to buy",tr:"xaridlar ro'yxati",ex:"Foraging can take a few items off your shopping list."},
      {w:"fungi",p:"noun",ipa:"/ˈfʌŋɡiː/",def:"(plural of fungus) plants without leaves, flowers or green colouring, such as mushrooms",tr:"zamburug'lar",ex:"Some fungi are delicious, but others are deadly."}
