      {w:"regeneration",p:"noun",ipa:"/rɪˌdʒenəˈreɪʃn/",def:"the natural process of growing again",tr:"qayta tiklanish / regeneratsiya",ex:"Hair regeneration slows down as we get older."},
      {w:"goosebump",p:"noun",ipa:"/ˈɡuːsbʌmp/",def:"(usually plural) another spelling of goose bump: small raised spots on the skin caused by cold or fear",tr:"g'oz terisi (teri tikkayishi)",ex:"The film's ending gave me goosebumps."}
