      {w:"unsubstantiated",p:"adjective",ipa:"/ˌʌnsəbˈstænʃieɪtɪd/",def:"not proved to be true by evidence",tr:"isbotlanmagan, asossiz",ex:"Most conspiracy theories are based on unsubstantiated claims."}
